{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:45:29+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:45:29+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"ASM International NV","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"Netherlands","city":"Almere","website":"https://www.asm.com","employees":4908,"summary":"ASM International NV, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the research, development, manufacturing, marketing, and servicing of equipment and materials used to produce semiconductor devices in the United States, Europe, and Asia. The company offers equipment used in wafer processing, which encompasses the fabrication steps in which silicon wafers are layered with semiconductor devices. It also provides wafer-processing deposition systems for surface modification, atomic layer deposition (ALD), such as plasma enhanced ALD (PEALD); epitaxy (Epi); plasma enhanced chemical vapor deposition (PECVD); and vertical furnace systems, including low pressure chemical vapor deposition (LPCVD), diffusion, oxidation, and cure. In addition, the company provides silicon carbide epitaxy (SiC Epi) tools for power and wafer applications; chemical mechanical polishing equipment for compound semiconductors and More-than-Moore manufacturing; and spare parts and support services. It sells its products to semiconductor manufacturers. The company was formerly known as Advanced Semiconductor Materials International NV. ASM International NV was incorporated in 1968 and is headquartered in Almere, the Netherlands.","exchange":"Amsterdam","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"ASM International NV, avec ses filiales, se consacre à la recherche, au développement, à la fabrication, à la commercialisation et à l'entretien des équipements et des matériaux utilisés pour produire des dispositifs à semi-conducteurs aux États-Unis, en Europe et en Asie. La société propose des équipements utilisés dans le traitement des plaquettes, qui englobe les étapes de fabrication dans lesquelles les plaquettes de silicium sont stratifiées avec des dispositifs à semi-conducteurs. Il fournit également des systèmes de dépôt de wafer-traitement pour la modification de surface, dépôt de couche atomique (ALD), tels que plasma amélioré ALD (PEALD); épitaxie (Epi); plasma amélioré dépôt en phase vapeur chimique (PECVD); et les systèmes de four vertical, y compris le dépôt en phase vapeur chimique à basse pression (LPCVD), la diffusion, l'oxydation et la cuisson."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":37100945408,"shares_outstanding":48817034,"trailing_pe":35.714283,"forward_pe":24.019453,"price_to_book":8.369951,"ev_to_ebitda":31.275,"ev_to_revenue":10.736,"dividend_yield":0.0044,"payout_ratio":0.1487,"beta_yahoo":1.494},"targets":{"current_price":760.0,"mean":1148.4,"median":1187.0,"high":1457.0,"low":690.0,"n_analysts":20,"reco_mean":1.65,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-27"],"eps_avg":6.26009,"eps_low":5.91861,"eps_high":6.6,"revenue_avg":1104970410,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-13","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.047340002,"institutions_pct":0.65492994,"institutions_float_pct":0.68748003,"institutions_n":669,"institutions":[{"name":"Atlas Capital Advisors Inc","pct":0.0,"shares":39,"value":29640,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":382,"value":290320,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0495},{"name":"Stanley-Laman Group, Ltd.","pct":0.0,"shares":1076,"value":817760,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":1.1434}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0139,"shares":687167,"value":522246920,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0101},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0092,"shares":455542,"value":346211920,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0127},{"name":"INVESTMENT MANAGERS SERIES TRUST-WCM Focused Internat